<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>@page{margin:70px}body{font-family:DejaVu Serif,serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#18251f}.head{text-align:center;border-bottom:3px double #075f4c;padding-bottom:16px}.head h1{margin:0;font-size:20px}.meta{margin:30px 0}.sign{margin-top:70px}</style></head><body><div class="head"><h1>Bangladesh High Commission</h1><div>Brunei Darussalam</div></div><div class="meta"><strong>Reference:</strong> {{ $worker->token->token_number }} / {{ $worker->token->bhc_number?:'BHC pending' }}<br><strong>Date:</strong> {{ now()->format('d F Y') }}</div><p><strong>Subject: {{ $type==='d1'?'D1 employment processing letter':'Worker confirmation letter' }}</strong></p><p>This is to certify that <strong>{{ $worker->full_name }}</strong>, holder of Bangladesh passport <strong>{{ $worker->passport_number }}</strong>, is recorded under the visa and worker submission of <strong>{{ $worker->token->company->name }}</strong> through recruiting agency <strong>{{ $worker->token->agency->name }}</strong>.</p><p>The worker's current registration reference is <strong>{{ $worker->registration_number?:'pending assignment' }}</strong> and visa status is <strong>{{ ucfirst($worker->visa_status) }}</strong>. This document reflects the latest approved information in the official system as at the generation date.</p><p>This letter is issued for authorized administrative processing.</p><div class="sign">____________________________<br>Authorized Officer<br>Bangladesh High Commission, Brunei Darussalam</div></body></html>
